    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8a100acd_34861a13",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-15T14:11:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `DawnPartialLoadResolveTexture` has two parts:\n- The expand step.\n- The resolve step.\n\nIt looks like D3D12 backend will still re-use the expand step in `BlitColorToColorWithDraw.cpp`. That means the resolve texture will be used as a source texture in this render pass (`D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_PIXEL_SHADER_RESOURCE` state). Is that conflicted with `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_DEST` state here?\n\nI\u0027m not sure why D3D12 validation layer didn\u0027t complain anything.\n\nFurthermore, if a D3D12 render pass is used, can we actually use a texture in both `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_DEST` \u0026 `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_PIXEL_SHADER_RESOURCE ` state? I\u0027m not sure whether it\u0027s allowed.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 1410,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "71156c9d5c072d115d0684854f4beee51dac9981",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "61ecffe4_d7e0e1b1",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000280
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-17T08:14:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch, thanks Quyen!\n\nI think this should be D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_PIXEL_SHADER_RESOURCE.\nBut I still didn\u0027t understand why D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RENDER_TARGET works with textureLoad during Expand, and D3D12 validation layer doesn\u0027t complain.",
      "parentUuid": "8a100acd_34861a13",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 1410,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "71156c9d5c072d115d0684854f4beee51dac9981",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1f25beb5_220db6ea",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-17T08:43:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t do resource transitions here as it should already be done in [1] or [4].\n\nAlso the resolving is done at [2] then [3] that has the correct resource transition at [4].",
      "parentUuid": "61ecffe4_d7e0e1b1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 1410,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "71156c9d5c072d115d0684854f4beee51dac9981",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6bea8e1d_b0531579",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-17T09:21:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When the texture is used as the source of the expanding step, it will have [kResolveAttachmentLoadingUsage](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/PassResourceUsageTracker.cpp;drc\u003dfd85c972694b3c1b6680052c35acf7d194471838;l\u003d139) not `wgpu::TextureUsage::TextureBinding`. This is special usage we assign in front-end so that the backend should know how to handle this specifically. It also helps prevent front-end from detecting that the texture is used as both resource and render attachment in the same render pass and would have thrown a validation error.\n\nFor example, vulkan has to add certain [usage bits](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/vulkan/TextureVk.cpp;drc\u003dfd85c972694b3c1b6680052c35acf7d194471838;l\u003d159) for it during resource transitions.\n\nWe should do the same for D3D12 [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/TextureD3D12.cpp;drc\u003dfd85c972694b3c1b6680052c35acf7d194471838;l\u003d63), in D3D12, I think can just simply set the resource usage to `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_PIXEL_SHADER_RESOURCE`",
      "parentUuid": "1f25beb5_220db6ea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 1410,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "71156c9d5c072d115d0684854f4beee51dac9981",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "27f1ad58_10748a94",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-17T09:22:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We shouldn\u0027t do resource transitions here as it should already be done in [1] or [4].\n\nI think [4] only correctly assigns `D3D12_RESOURCE_STATE_RESOLVE_DEST` when D3D12 render pass is [not used](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp;drc\u003dfd85c972694b3c1b6680052c35acf7d194471838;l\u003d1789). When the render pass is used, it is currently relying on the transition done before `BeginRenderPass`. I think we should remove the transition here, and move it to [this place](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp;drc\u003dfd85c972694b3c1b6680052c35acf7d194471838;l\u003d1788) where the `ID3D12CommandList::EndRenderPass` is called.",
      "parentUuid": "6bea8e1d_b0531579",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
        "endLine": 1410,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "71156c9d5c072d115d0684854f4beee51dac9981",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "289eda9d_94050973",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/CommandBufferD3D12.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1410,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-17T09:26:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "anw, the D3D validation layer not catching this seems to be problematic. Since CQ relies on the validation layer to catch these transition errors but for some reasons, it didn\u0027t work reliably.",
      "parentUuid": "27f1ad58_10748a94",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1410,
        "startChar": 36,
